t","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167389428,"discussion_id":"140e8044e54966550cedabeecd10cc038a8cb85b","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复统一缓冲区（UB）内存布局定义中的偏移量错误。原代码在初始化输出张量时，错误地使用了`reluInPingUbOffset`作为零值数据缓冲区的起始地址，这可能导致内存访问越界或数据污染，影响算子计算的正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在统一缓冲区的内存布局定义中，显式添加了`zeroDataUbOffset`常量以标识零值数据缓冲区的起始位置。随后，在`InitOutputDqAndDweights`函数中，将获取零值数据缓冲区的偏移量从错误的`reluInPingUbOffset`更正为新定义的`zeroDataUbOffset`，从而确保了内存访问的正确性和数据隔离。","created_at":"2026-04-03T16:52:18+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-03T16:52:18+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167393359,"discussion_id":"aac9a7396ac25a4381b08425eb602249a3495012","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-04-03T17:09:07+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-03T17:09:07+08:00","user":{"id":"688ad193747ec37916719403","login":"DaiHuina1","object_id":"688ad193747ec37916719403","name":"DaiHuina1","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/DaiHuina1"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167393886,"discussion_id":"1e6d6153e0746476f4fa9cec50a88e80e3c11764","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=374c3e96995641228275e5095243faba&projectName=CANN'>374c3e96995641228275e5095243faba</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                 